A||||16||rogergarrison||My Peives on Movies These Days||||1||
Z||000000||rogergarrison||12-23-2001||03:39 PM||||Ive got 2 pet peeves from the movie industry.<P>1. They always brag about how this new movie has broken all box office records. Well, it may make more MONEY, but its not due to that much more attendance.......its because ticket prices have gone up like what.... 700%. I think they ought to start basing these claims on NUMBER of tickets, not how much money it makes.<P>2. Now there making nominations for best pictures, actors, etc for the year.......of movies that havent even been released yet! Wouldnt they feel kinda stupid to give best picture of the year to a movie, only to find out it totally bombs at the door, you know like 50 people go to see it !<P>Maybe its just me being to critical, but thats how I see it anyway.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 12-23-2001).]||||reg||1
